  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MFC1-02 Strengthening Climate Resilience of Communities and Marine Ecosystems in Palau</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation International Aotearoa&#xa0;will work with communities in Palau, especially women fishers, to have increase capacity to adopt climate-sensitive sustainable aquaculture practices. The Activity will deliver this through value chain analysis of giant clams, increased access and supply of giant clam seed to rural community members, building technical and business capacity of fishers, especially women, and increasing women&apos;s participation in national policy and regulatory discussions.</narrative>
  </description>
